      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This is more likely a unity bug than a vrchat bug, unless this is only showing up in vrchat. You may also want to double check the material used on the terrain to see if the textures and such are set to be transparent at all. You can also turn off the lightmap static option for terrain if all else fails. (Just click the arrow next to the static check box in the inspector and look for lightmap and uncheck it.) Also may be worth checking the grass and trees if they're the only things showing through the ground like that.",
      "viewerReactions": null
