  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Because of the black terrain bug, I have been trying to use the workaround of swapping the terrain material to a custom material from the Nature/Terrain folder so that I can have both baked lighting and terrain. However, this has resulted in semi-transparent terrain (see photo where you can see trees in the distance underground). The only way I and Super Coyote ! have found to make Baked Directional Lights + Unity terrain work is by turning shadows off on the baked directional light. ",
